# M7 online, mode 3 (own games): every player plays an own save (sent to
# the others at the start of the player's stream); every machine shows
# every player's game, its own players large. Every machine's first player
# solves 0level; then everybody presses at once; every machine must agree.
size 1280x720
# The first launch plays the intro: hold a key to skip it.
wait 150
hold enter 70
idle 400
expect state play baba/0level
@host online host private ${ROOMFILE}
@m1 online join code ${ROOMFILE}
@!m0,m1 online join invite ${ROOMFILE}
@host online wait 90 machines=${MACHINES}
@host online mode own
online seats ${LOCALS}
@host shot 01-room
online wait 90 online session
online wait 60 views=${PLAYERS}
online settle 30
shot 02-session
l1 idle 900
l1 solve
online wait-level 90 l1 baba/106level
online settle 30
shot 03-own-progress
online bots 8
online settle 60
shot 04-bots
key f3
shot 05-equal-tiles
@host online end
online wait 90 online room
online expect agreed
expect save 0 baba 0level 3
quit
